---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Every keyboard shortcut in the TUI and the web app, from one definition

Usage: mxr keys [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  explain      What a key does, in each client; with --context, what it does there
  check        Check keys.toml and name everything mxr would ignore in it
  set          Give an action its own keys in the TUI and the web app, in keys.toml. Writes nothing when a key belongs to another action
  reset        Give an action back its default keys
  single-keys  Turn every single-character shortcut on or off (WCAG 2.1.4). Modifier chords such as Mod+k, Escape, Enter and the arrows keep working
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --client <CLIENT>    Only this client's keys [possible values: tui, web]
      --context <CONTEXT>  Only keys live in this place: a TUI context or web scope, such as todo
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
